+# ERP-like board enhancement, unpublished patch
+
+Base: r92 e970cd180c26b17bfaa7b42a3b0b0a20655245fe.
+
+Implemented in existing four boards: typed rich text editor, inline PNG/JPEG images, up to five attachments (5 MB each, 10 MB total), authenticated file downloads, title/body search and Seoul-local date filters. Existing site and role restrictions remain; no permissions expanded. Legacy resource file download and optional replacement remain available. Existing document updates require a rich-aware client to avoid silent loss. Removed attachments are retained privately as inactive. No raw HTML is accepted or rendered.
+
+Apply `supabase/migrations/20261109010000_board_rich_content.sql` before publishing the Edge Function and client. No production migration, deployment, remote push, or production data edit has been performed.
+
+Passed: node --check platform-dashboard.js; tests/board-rich-content.cjs; tests/integrated-boards.cjs; tests/integrated-home-content.cjs.
+Independent review identified base64 newline handling, old-client document mismatch, file-read save race, and legacy replacement regression. All four were corrected; server regression tests rerun.
+
+Browser test prepared at tests/board-rich-browser.cjs but could not run in this environment: Chromium process_singleton socket() Operation not permitted, including permitted escalation attempt. Actual desktop/mobile visual and browser end-to-end verification remains required before deployment. No visual success is claimed.
+
+Not implemented: new comment/favorite/view-counter functionality, new disclosure/notice options, or changes to existing access. Those need explicit fit to current app data and permissions, rather than copying broader ERP options.
